{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlrxwfo0ths0","created":1790699234405,"text":"模型评估与选择"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlrxwp9i6u80","created":1790699255295,"text":"经验误差与过拟合"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlscyokpmow0","created":1790741727173,"text":"错误率"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczsa9vu00","created":1790741813613,"text":"分类错误占总数的比例"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlscyt9o37c0","created":1790741737389,"text":"精度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlscztrv9gw0","created":1790741816853,"text":"精度=1-错误率"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlscz0ade4o0","created":1790741752670,"text":"经验误差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczurghi80","created":1790741819005,"text":"学习器在训练集上的误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsczf6lnxk0","created":1790741785093,"text":"泛化误差"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczvmxx7k0","created":1790741820909,"text":"学习器在新数据集上的误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsczgfc1aw0","created":1790741787797,"text":"过拟合"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczxgfqq00","created":1790741824869,"text":"学习能力太强，特性也作为判断标准"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlscznepfqo0","created":1790741802997,"text":"欠拟合"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsczyt4jew0","created":1790741827813,"text":"学习能力太差，有一个特征便判断正确"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxwro0zw80","created":1790699260527,"text":"评估方法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd4hkspog0","created":1790742182125,"text":"留出法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd55hp8o00","created":1790742234181,"text":"采用分层采样法，测试集和训练集都是一半正例一半反例"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsd4jdronk0","created":1790742186054,"text":"k折交叉验证"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd56fpels0","created":1790742236237,"text":"样本分成k份，k-1份训练，1份测试，得到k轮数据"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsd4mxphps0","created":1790742193790,"text":"自助法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd57mfwbk0","created":1790742238821,"text":"有放回的从m个样本中取出m个样本作为训练集，只要轮数够多，就有36.8%的数据取不到，作为测试集，其余作为训练集。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdi2hed140","created":1790743246366,"text":"也叫自助采样法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlsdiuqtdao0","created":1790743307886,"text":"外包估计"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsdizyoxo80","created":1790743319246,"text":"实际评估的模型与期望评估的模型都使用m个训练样本\n，而我们仍有数据总量约1/3的、没有在训练集中出现的样本用于测试"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlsd58zimwo0","created":1790742241789,"text":"调参与最终模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlsd5kryr080","created":1790742267453,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxwscxpmw0","created":1790699262033,"text":"性能度量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxwt5h9uo0","created":1790699263759,"text":"比较检验"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlrxz1erluw0","created":1790699438463,"text":"偏差与方差"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}